		<title type="html"><![CDATA[DefColStudio - Interactive Deformable Modeling Framework]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=297#p297"><![CDATA[
DefColStudio is a simulation framework implementing several methods for deformable modeling and collision handling. In addition to the interactive simulation of soft bodies, the framework also features nice rendering based on OGRE, an easy to use GUI based on CEGUI, and console and scripting capabilities. You can download the demo, papers and more at: <br><br><a href="http://graphics.ethz.ch/~brunoh/defcolstudio.html" class="postlink">http://graphics.ethz.ch/~brunoh/defcolstudio.html</a><p>Statistics: Posted by Guest — Tue Sep 06, 2005 7:39 pm</p><hr />
